          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Daqaní inqwaarír ta afkú heémár wa qaasi ka tleehhi ar neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/ nee sirdaa/aten nee ar da/atene nee ar kitaánír hhohho' ar taa hhuútl, ka qaalin ló'wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uheemaá kooán awa masqaryaán ki tléhh as tuuntukumár afkú do' nee ki ninkiríts ar sahaábu sleeme, daqaní muqslár sirdaa/aten ka kwahhút as yukumáy kuwa tlehh oo ta gwe'eedér uheemidá' wa qas.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.37"
            ]
          }
        }
